cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the accompanying magniFIND-seq
  manuscript and the archived software release used for your analysis.
title: magniFIND-seq analysis pipeline
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Seung Won
    family-names: Shin
  - given-names: Sakshi
    family-names: Shah
  - given-names: Chenchen
    family-names: Xia
  - given-names: Atsuki
    family-names: Kawamura
  - given-names: Zhihui
    family-names: Wang
  - given-names: Yuanrong
    family-names: Kang
  - given-names: Nicole
    family-names: Klatt
