license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Portable workflows for magniFIND-seq gene-expression quantification,
  raw read/UMI quality control, targeted and public-dataset BCR::ABL1 fusion
  analysis, PBMC/K562 embedding, and bulk-to-single-cell expression concordance.
keywords:
  - magniFIND-seq
  - single-cell RNA sequencing
  - UMI
  - fusion detection
  - bioinformatics
